    "detailed_description": "Railborn is a survival game where you build your train piece by piece. Navigate a world entangled by branching tracks. Find rare plants to cultivate on your farms. Upgrade your train - manage its power systems, direct resource flow, and distribute water. Designed for 1 to 4 players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/99143e782dc678b527e4cbe31672f38a.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/5ac1586a9b07c968d3927ad757049f99.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Construct your train piece by piece, floor by floor, railcar by railcar.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/da14e5a240519c7c1331187383b07bc0.poster.avif?t=1751579617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/da14e5a240519c7c1331187383b07bc0.webm?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/da14e5a240519c7c1331187383b07bc0.mp4?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/cba4381e5f08539a557ed4fedb704d33.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Play alone or in co-op mode with your friends.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/70ddbf17351ca267cfb225d5f8d1afcc.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Navigate branching paths that carve through mountains and dive into the sea.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/96cdfb2a0cbe6226cd91a7f05fcd26f2.poster.avif?t=1751579617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/96cdfb2a0cbe6226cd91a7f05fcd26f2.webm?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/96cdfb2a0cbe6226cd91a7f05fcd26f2.mp4?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/a1084fc72040598af582d535a7ade822.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Beyond the train lies a hostile, dying world.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/ef7ec9e4318e028121b7659f95b26cc9.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Manage power systems, direct resource flow, capture and distribute water.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/13fb3aeaced819bedff23b7337a2a4dd.poster.avif?t=1751579617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/13fb3aeaced819bedff23b7337a2a4dd.webm?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/13fb3aeaced819bedff23b7337a2a4dd.mp4?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/2e4a2188418b2d42c349fa852e11a70b.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Recreate biomes on your train.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/875663d7218d1df4407740d7c6b57c00.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Uncover the truth behind a planet consumed by endless tracks.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/cc4be96c3fef4e03f82c27c01ba6f814.webp?t=1751579617\" /></span>Pilot your train up the ultimate track rising into space.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/e6983d46e0f3b424b3d4345b2f4f38d3.poster.avif?t=1751579617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/e6983d46e0f3b424b3d4345b2f4f38d3.webm?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/e6983d46e0f3b424b3d4345b2f4f38d3.mp4?t=1751579617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
